  "description": "gRPC client and server caching interceptors for Dragonfire.Caching.\nAdds cache-aside semantics to outbound and inbound unary gRPC calls. Cache keys are built\nfrom proto-generated request fields via Google.Protobuf descriptor reflection — no\n[Cache] attributes are required on proto-generated types. Per-method rules (TTL, key\ntemplate, tags, invalidation patterns) are configured at DI registration time.",
